              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "torreō, torrēre — \"to roast, to toast, to parch\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Ad focum pānem torrēbat. He was toasting bread by the hearth."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "torreō, torrēre, torruī, tostum. English toast comes from tostum, and torrid from the verb."
            }
          ]
        },
